<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center py-12">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">OWASP ASVS Assessment Tool</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600">
    This is an open-source tool designed to help developers, security teams, and auditors
    assess their applications against the OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS).
  </p>

  <div class="mt-6">
    <a href="https://github.com/marcbest/owasp-asvs"
       target="_blank"
       class="inline-block bg-gray-900 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-700 transition">
      View on GitHub
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800">Features</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-gray-700 text-lg">
      <li>✅ Easily track ASVS compliance for your projects</li>
      <li>✅ Supports multiple ASVS versions</li>
      <li>✅ Interactive assessments with auto-save</li>
      <li>✅ Open-source and built with Rails 8, Hotwire, and TailwindCSS</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10">
    <% if user_signed_in? %>
      <a href="<%= assessments_path %>"
         class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
        Go to My Assessments
      </a>
    <% else %>
      <a href="<%= new_user_registration_path %>"
         class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-green-700 transition">
        Get Started
      </a>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
